e9g","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-21T23:02:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T23:02:53Z","body":"> I can't reproduce this on Linux/X11 with KDE 6.6.5, even when accessibility support is set to **Always Active** in the editor settings:\n> \n> > Godot v4.7.beta ([8608217](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/86082170822e19ebb619c7f53c8fe54a6f8d3d2a)) - Fedora Linux 44 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 595.71.05) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n> \n> I followed the same steps as in the video, i.e. click on various text fields in the Customize Run Instances dialog.\n\nThanks for checking this. I still suspect it might be related to tiling or highly dynamic window managers, especially Awesome WM.\nSimilar behavior could likely appear in other WMs with comparable window management and focus handling on X11.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4513455862/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4569240536","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4569240536","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4569240536,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEFkT2A","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-28T23:48:21Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T23:48:21Z","body":"I checked this to help find you the problem.\n\nIn version 4.7-dev3 and above this is not present.\n\nI noticed that the interface changed after this version. Specifically why this got fixed I did not look for because I do not understand the architecture of what was done.\n\nBut below I will attach screenshots as facts.\n\n---\n\n4.6.2 stable:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0bdc6b3-ae6a-49a4-bdbf-0871c1ce2523\" />\n\n4.6.3 stable\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4fac24a5-11a6-4e56-8f0f-8a24f846a860\" />\n\n4.7 dev 2\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97f71fdc-569d-4f65-8f33-375292e525ee\" />\n\n4.7 beta 3\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd1497a6-a3a6-4460-b1d3-e24294784468\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4569240536/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4610397200","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4610397200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4610397200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEs0UEA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T08:19:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T08:19:42Z","body":"I can't reproduce it. Looking at screenshots, the error in the log is from window focus event which for some reason is set either too late or too early. It should not have any effect apart from printed message and unlikely directly related to the crash.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4610397200/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611146527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4611146527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4611146527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEtiDHw","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T09:58:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T10:03:20Z","body":"> I can't reproduce it. Looking at screenshots, the error in the log is from window focus event which for some reason is set either too late or too early.\n\nWhich window manager did you test this on? I think it is already quite obvious that this appears on free tiling window managers such as \"Awesome\". Since I am saying this for the third time, I think you will pay attention to it.\n\nI think there are other window managers similar to \"Awesome\" that may cause this as well, but I am not an expert on them. I just know that this is the one I use, and it is very flexible when it comes to changing focus, very flexible. Therefore, if you tested this, it would be good to at least specify how.\n\nAs for whether this is a bad error or not — there is an error in the console. Under normal conditions, it should not be there. I already pointed out that it was fixed. As can be seen, the window handling was changed in newer versions, and now it no longer causes the error.\n\n> It should not have any effect apart from printed message and unlikely directly related to the crash.\n\nI initially wrote that this causes a crash if this error is triggered several times in a row. Did you read that? If you did not read it, then now you are aware that this is the case.\n\n---\n\nNote: By the way, if you assigned this to version 4.7, then I already wrote that it is fixed in it. So this is not a 4.7 milestone, am I right? In any case, this has been present throughout the entire 4.6 version.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611146527/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611189797","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4611189797","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4611189797,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEtksJQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,