m/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T10:06:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T10:06:58Z","body":"> The 4.7 milestone doesn't indicate that it appeared in 4.7 but that it is a goal to fix it in 4.7\n\nYes, I was actually about to write that before you posted it. What I mean is that I tested it and wrote above that 4.7 dev 2 is the last version with this bug. What I mean is that if you consider this a blocker for version 4.7 stable, then it is not, because this bug is not present in >= 4.7 beta 3 right now.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611210064/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611257477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4611257477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4611257477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEto0hQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T10:12:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T10:19:01Z","body":"Thank you for clarifying (in the future it'd be much appreciated if that detail was added to the top of the issue for easy access, it can easily be missed in long threads, i.e. to update when new information becomes available)\n\nThen we'd possibly need to find a fix merged at that point that might be cherry-picked for a future 4.6.x version","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611257477/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611257517","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4611257517","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4611257517,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEto0rQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T10:12:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T10:12:42Z","body":"So to be sure we understand correctly:\n\n- The error was only seen on Linux on Awesome WM so far\n- There was a crash once, but not reproduced since, while the error can be easily reproduced\n- The error is reproduced in 4.6.2-stable and 4.6.3-stable. Could you test 4.6-stable too just to confirm it wasn't introduced in 4.6.x via a cherry-pick?\n- The error is reproduced in 4.7-dev2 but not 4.7-beta3, so it appears to be fixed in `master`. Could you test intermediate snapshots between 4.7-dev2 and 4.7-beta3 to pinpoint the first one that fixed the error? This might help identify which commit fixed it in `master`, so it could be cherry-picked for the next 4.6.x release.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611257517/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611381946","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4611381946","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4611381946,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEtwaug","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T10:27:34Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T10:27:34Z","body":"> There was a crash once, but not reproduced since, while the error can be easily reproduced\n\nPerhaps I was not understanding you correctly before. If you were able to reproduce the bug easily, that is one thing — but, as I understand it, the people who tested it above were not able to reproduce it?\n\nYes, `Awesome WM` and similar ones are so far the only explanation. It would be great if someone else could test with this window manager as well. Because such window managers provide complete freedom in window switching, focus handling, and many other things. Therefore, many windows that were implemented as separate ones became visible with different focus states. As far as I remember, I wrote about this at the very beginning here and in other issues related to window problems.\n\nIn any case, if you need to reproduce the crash, you simply need to trigger this error several times until some kind of overflow occurs or something along those lines — then the editor will crash. So it is not difficult to reproduce either.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611381946/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611490462","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4611490462","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4611490462,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEt3Cng","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T10:42:24Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T10:42:24Z","body":"> Which window manager did you test this on?\n\nOnly tiling manager I tested with was Sway (XWayland), so it is not reproducible with any timing manager, but if it's specific to Awesome (or native X11) it is not a representative test.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611490462/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611494571","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4611494571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4611494571,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEt3Sqw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T10:43:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T10:43:01Z","body":"> > There was a crash once, but not reproduced since, while the error can be easily reproduced\n> \n> Perhaps I was not understanding you correctly before. If you were able to reproduce the bug easily, that is one thing — but, as I understand it, the people who tested it above were not able to reproduce it?\n\nWhat I meant is that _you_ are able to reproduce the error easily. I hadn't tested myself.\nI run Linux but I have no experience with tiling managers so testing something unfamiliar like Awesome can be tricky (how do I even run an app in this empty WM? etc.).\n\nBut I gave it a try now, figured out how to get a terminal so I can run some apps, 1998 style.\n\nI could reproduce the issue with 4.6-stable, 4.6.1-stable, 4.6.2-stable, 4.6.3-stable, and 4.7-dev2. It is fixed in **4.7-dev3**.\n\nSo far I haven't managed to get a crash however when reproducing the error. Since it seems to be mostly harmless, and fixed in 4.7, I suggest we can close this issue as fixed.\n\nIf a fix is really wanted for 4.6.4, then you could try to [bisect](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/reporting_issues/bisecting.html) between 4.7-dev2 (778cf54da) and 4.7-dev3 (60fff00a6) to pinpoint which commit fixed the issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611494571/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611686858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4611686858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4611686858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEuDByg","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T11:07:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T11:07:29Z","body":"> What I meant is that _you_ are able to reproduce the error easily. I hadn't tested myself. I run Linux but I have no experience with tiling managers so testing something unfamiliar like Awesome can be tricky (how do I even run an app in this empty WM? etc.).\n> \n> But I gave it a try now, figured out how to get a terminal so I can run some apps, 1998 style.\n\nIt is not about style; everything can be configured, including key bindings and basically everything. Its main feature is precisely that it shows real windows instead of hiding them. Because of that, you can quickly manipulate focus, sizes, and everything else. It is very convenient — if you tried working with it for some time, it really is very convenient.\n\nBut I think you understood the problem: when several updates were released in a row to extract windows as independent ones, even though they were always inside the engine window, many issues like this started to appear. That is why it was fixed in the latest versions — because now you can see a name, an icon, and I think there were larger changes, and it was changed from a normal unnamed window to a proper window with proper control over it. Before that, you could say that the window state was not being handled correctly, which is a typical issue in C/C++ in terms of resources.\n\n> So far I haven't managed to get a crash however when reproducing the error. Since it seems to be mostly harmless, and fixed in 4.7, I suggest we can close this issue as fixed.\n\nThis can be achieved by opening and closing this window many times. At least this is how it was in my case, and I tested it several times.\n\nAs for this issue, the decision on how to handle it is up to you. But personally, I have already said that this is not a blocker for 4.7. So for me this problem is resolved; I will simply move to 4.7 in the future, where windows are managed more correctly.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611686858/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611802214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118553#issuecomment-4611802214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118553","id":4611802214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEuKEZg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T11:23:34Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T11:23:34Z","body":"Alright, closing as fixed in 4.7 then :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4611802214/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]